  "description": "The digest's test-matter predicate, copied verbatim from WF5 Build Daily Digest node 983da561, must recognise a synthetic QA matter by id prefix, title wording, recorded facts or risk flags.",
  "why_it_exists": "QA runs create matters in the same register as real work. If the daily digest cannot tell them apart it reports synthetic matters to the owner as live legal work. The Stage 2 caller re-implements the predicate verbatim and asserts against it, so a drift between the digest's copy and the QA copy is caught rather than assumed away.",
